This is the reusable road.


---

22. Paid Models Are a Later Phase

The current engineering focus is:

> LOCAL MODEL INFRASTRUCTURE FIRST.



Paid providers will be designed later.

However, the local architecture must expose a clean interface so that paid models can eventually connect to the broader CNS Model/Brain Bus.

Therefore:

LOCAL
   │
   ├── Qwen
   ├── DeepSeek
   ├── GLM
   └── Future models

REMOTE FREE
   │
   └── later

PAID
   │
   └── later

All eventually meet at the broader CNS model interface.


